license: MIT
keywords:
  - NASA C3X
  - conjugate heat transfer
  - turbine vane
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - Ansys Fluent
  - RANS
  - benchmark
  - numerical verification
  - measurement comparison
abstract: >-
  A reduced two-dimensional steady compressible RANS/CHT benchmark of NASA C3X
  Run 145. The repository contains documented Fluent exports and a Python
  workflow for convergence, mesh sensitivity, conservation, wall resolution,
  and quantitative comparison with public NASA pressure and thermal measurements.

